One, they are not fast enough. For huge&nbsp;
scenes in full HD or higher resolution,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.774 --> 00:01:08.654
getting a real time solution is tough.&nbsp;
It typically goes slower than that.

00:01:08.654 --> 00:01:16.994
And two, of course thin structures, it’s always&nbsp;
the thin structures that are a problem. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:22.934
these are quite plentiful in scenes in the&nbsp;
